  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- BREAKING: Switched from ApplicationInsights to OpenTelemetry\n- BREAKING: BaseCrudController does not return 404 on empty results in GetAll anymore.\n- New options for OpenTelemetry introduced.\n- OTEL now has optional option UrlsToExcludeFromTracing.\n- OTEL now has optional option AdditionalUrlsToExcludeFromTracing.\n- New options OnOtelUrlIgnored and OnOtelConfigured in options.\n- Fixed double slashes in OpenApi auth flow URLs.\n- New ConfigurationOptions.OnExceptionMiddlewareException allows to react on default exception middleware.\n- New ConfigurationOptions.OpenApiShouldIncludeResolver allows to custom define the resolver.\n- New ConfigurationOptions.CreateDefaultSchemaReferenceId allows to override the schema reference creation logic.\n- PrefetchOptions.ResponseTimeoutMilliseconds allows to control the amount of time to wait on every prefetch request.\n- Prefetch now logs durations and has \"KHAN Startup\" as logger name.\n- Package updates.\n- Added explicit reference to System.Security.Cryptography.Xml due to supply-chain-vuln.",
